{"3583210":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Crashout Crew","steam_appid":3583210,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4736070],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At DE NILE SHIPPING, things move fast. And if they don’t, you’re the problem. Make a crew of <strong>up to 4<\/strong> overworked friends and drive into a frantic co-op forklift experience where teamwork is key, and disaster is inevitable.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER WAREHOUSE MAYHEM <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research shows the best way to hit impossible deadlines is to build for speed, not safety. That’s why our warehouse isn’t just a workplace, it’s a <strong>full-blown raceway<\/strong>! Our forklifts come tricked out with boost and drift capabilities for maximum productivity (and employee enrichment). Just try not to smash into each other.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/a225e686ffe74ad476559e14a6bece72.poster.avif?t=1781802315\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/a225e686ffe74ad476559e14a6bece72.mp4?t=1781802315\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GRAB IT, STACK IT, SHIP IT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to our forklifts’ patented “<strong><i>Easy-Grab<\/i><\/strong><i>” <\/i>functionality, sorting and stacking is a breeze. Remember to constantly yell at your coworkers to keep the warehouse organized to avoid becoming buried under a pile of missed quotas. And chickens.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/a3cdb9788f0b41732291703a922dc650.poster.avif?t=1781802315\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/a3cdb9788f0b41732291703a922dc650.mp4?t=1781802315\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULFILL RIDICULOUS ORDERS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our warehouse is equipped to handle the most outlandish orders from across the globe. Lemons, anvils, explosives, primates… if you can dream it, we can deliver it! Fulfill a variety of unique contracts with over 20 types of boxes guaranteed to make your job a <strong>physics-based<\/strong> nightmare!!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/dc142278b67cd4b85b47a4af8d36ef25.poster.avif?t=1781802315\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/dc142278b67cd4b85b47a4af8d36ef25.mp4?t=1781802315\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DE NILE SHIPPING understands that customer convenience comes at the cost of employee safety, so please handle any volatile orders with care. Any damages will come out of your paycheck!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADES, UPGRADES, UPGRADES!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We might be out of budget for warehouse improvements, but you’re still welcome to spend your own hard-earned cash on new devices and forklift upgrades that are sure to make your job easier, if not a little safer!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/c0a4bbf1bad6410c36f205ae3263edec.poster.avif?t=1781802315\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/c0a4bbf1bad6410c36f205ae3263edec.mp4?t=1781802315\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online, lobby-based co-op physics chaos for up to 4 players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of contracts to complete, each with a unique set of crazy boxes to ship<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stress, and don’t <strong>crash out - <\/strong>or you’ll end up making your friends’ lives even tougher!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your warehouse and forklift to make the job easier! It’ll all reset after the contract, so no need to hoard your money!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Safety Violations modify the warehouse to add even more chaos! If the shift was tough before, just wait until the lights go out! <\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At DE NILE SHIPPING, things move fast. And if they don’t, you’re the problem. Make a crew of <strong>up to 4<\/strong> overworked friends and drive into a frantic co-op forklift experience where teamwork is key, and disaster is inevitable.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER WAREHOUSE MAYHEM <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research shows the best way to hit impossible deadlines is to build for speed, not safety. That’s why our warehouse isn’t just a workplace, it’s a <strong>full-blown raceway<\/strong>! Our forklifts come tricked out with boost and drift capabilities for maximum productivity (and employee enrichment). Just try not to smash into each other.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/a225e686ffe74ad476559e14a6bece72.poster.avif?t=1781802315\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/a225e686ffe74ad476559e14a6bece72.mp4?t=1781802315\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GRAB IT, STACK IT, SHIP IT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to our forklifts’ patented “<strong><i>Easy-Grab<\/i><\/strong><i>” <\/i>functionality, sorting and stacking is a breeze. Remember to constantly yell at your coworkers to keep the warehouse organized to avoid becoming buried under a pile of missed quotas. And chickens.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/a3cdb9788f0b41732291703a922dc650.poster.avif?t=1781802315\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/a3cdb9788f0b41732291703a922dc650.mp4?t=1781802315\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULFILL RIDICULOUS ORDERS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our warehouse is equipped to handle the most outlandish orders from across the globe. Lemons, anvils, explosives, primates… if you can dream it, we can deliver it! Fulfill a variety of unique contracts with over 20 types of boxes guaranteed to make your job a <strong>physics-based<\/strong> nightmare!!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/dc142278b67cd4b85b47a4af8d36ef25.poster.avif?t=1781802315\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/dc142278b67cd4b85b47a4af8d36ef25.mp4?t=1781802315\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DE NILE SHIPPING understands that customer convenience comes at the cost of employee safety, so please handle any volatile orders with care. Any damages will come out of your paycheck!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADES, UPGRADES, UPGRADES!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We might be out of budget for warehouse improvements, but you’re still welcome to spend your own hard-earned cash on new devices and forklift upgrades that are sure to make your job easier, if not a little safer!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/c0a4bbf1bad6410c36f205ae3263edec.poster.avif?t=1781802315\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/extras\/c0a4bbf1bad6410c36f205ae3263edec.mp4?t=1781802315\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online, lobby-based co-op physics chaos for up to 4 players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of contracts to complete, each with a unique set of crazy boxes to ship<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stress, and don’t <strong>crash out - <\/strong>or you’ll end up making your friends’ lives even tougher!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your warehouse and forklift to make the job easier! It’ll all reset after the contract, so no need to hoard your money!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Safety Violations modify the warehouse to add even more chaos! If the shift was tough before, just wait until the lights go out! <\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Time to clock in at DE NILE SHIPPING, the world’s “most efficient” warehouse! Work together in online co-op with up to 4 players to fulfill orders of increasingly chaotic, physics-based boxes. Time is money, and safety is no concern… just try not to crash out!","supported_languages":"영어<strong>*<\/strong>, 프랑스어, 이탈리아어, 독일어, 스페인어 - 스페인, 일본어, 포르투갈어 - 브라질, 러시아어, 중국어 간체<br><strong>*<\/strong>음성이 지원되는 언어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/9eb7862ff717a04dcc02123ce1e773a3e1c226af\/header.jpg?t=1781802315","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/8c72003fa9b495893d862479f99c361ab647ded6\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781802315","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3583210\/8c72003fa9b495893d862479f99c361ab647ded6\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781802315","website":"http:\/\/aggrocrab.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>64비트 프로세서와 운영 체제가 필요합니다<br><\/li><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Dual Core 2.4Ghz<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> GTX 1050 or AMD equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> 버전 12<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 1500 MB 사용 가능 공간<br><\/li><li><strong>사운드카드:<\/strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card<br><\/li><li><strong>추가 사항:<\/strong> Gamepads Recommended<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>64비트 프로세서와 운영 체제가 필요합니다<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"© Aggro Crab 2026","developers":["Aggro Crab"],"publishers":["Aggro Crab"],"price_overview":{"currency":"KRW","initial":860000,"final":860000,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"₩ 8,